{"card": {"id": "qubit_8_1_3", "kind": "family", "identity": {"canonical_name": "Plenio-Vedral-Knight constant-excitation code", "variant": "fixed signed source subspace", "aliases": []}, "description": "A fixed stabilizer code whose source logical basis uses superpositions of bit strings with equal excitation. Relative signs select the encoded subspace. The executable tableau uses an explicit Pauli change of frame to make its generator eigenvalues positive; applying that Pauli again restores the source basis. This T1 skeleton covers the finite subspace and its Pauli distance. Dynamical noise behavior and recovery circuits are not surveyed.", "eczoo": {"status": "mapped", "zoo_id": "qubit_8_1_3", "classification": "exact-family", "source": {"blob_url": "https://github.com/errorcorrectionzoo/eczoo_data/blob/b2437d9e2dc09284e04c66ef72ee81b7ed7bd129/codes/quantum/qubits/small_distance/small/8/qubit_8_1_3.yml", "page_url": "https://errorcorrectionzoo.org/c/qubit_8_1_3", "path": "codes/quantum/qubits/small_distance/small/8/qubit_8_1_3.yml", "sha256": "515acc55bf1fcd5b753b261febe71d22b1645552b40e0bb4825291be8d2ad2a6", "commit": "b2437d9e2dc09284e04c66ef72ee81b7ed7bd129", "repository_url": "https://github.com/errorcorrectionzoo/eczoo_data", "retrieved_on": "2026-08-05"}}, "presentation": {"orienting_view": {"status": "available", "kind": "stabilizer-incidence"}, "guided_tour": {"status": "not-required", "until_tier": "T3"}}, "views": [{"rung": "R1", "type": "signed-source-mixed-pauli-tableau", "description": "Hermitian Y = iXZ and left-to-right source qubit order fix the phase convention. Common Pauli eigensymmetries of source equations (8)-(9) determine the tableau. Q = IIIIXZZY maps the signed source sector to the positive-generator sector; constant excitation is stated in the source frame. The constructor-derived picture displays incidence, not spatial locality. The signed rows and source-basis regression are documented in docs/lit/qubit_8_1_3/qubit_8_1_3-eczoo-intake.m